        rdfs:comment                   "Piece; foundation fabric of white silk cloth which appears in the very incomplete design of leafy sepentines and in many of the flowers which spring, in groups, alternately left and right, across the white serpentines; much of floral sprays brocaded in polychrome silks; background of design in blue ribbed silk fromed by warp floats; a number of cracks; right selvedge present."@en ;
